<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila miranda detail-scale Turing wavelength (1.9 µm, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 80.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 executes the Schnakenberg field (FFT wavelength 1.864 µm) and a 12-frame 640×480 GIF at fixed overlay depth 0.22. The pass-1 measurement set stops at wavelength and trace. Sweep, ablation, specimen segmentation, and dispersion Pearson/RMSE are the remediation items. Overall 80.3/100 (faithfulness 78.6, reproducibility 84.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 82, Parameter expressivity 64, Morphometric validation 70, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 80. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 576855 B, 1464×912 px, artifact_sha256 d7278ebb5fca3418b98c565fdd094af5c3aa3e21abb8efb0337b276adcdd1078 (sha256 d7278ebb5fca3418b98c565fdd094af5c3aa3e21abb8efb0337b276adcdd1078), spec_fingerprint d72df4485d107fdd15f1f53825f9d2fc9fb6708a151467f2a51b6d54ce339010. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d72df4485d107fdd15f1f53825f9d2fc9fb6708a151467f2a51b6d54ce339010; artifact_sha256: d7278ebb5fca3418b98c565fdd094af5c3aa3e21abb8efb0337b276adcdd1078; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0/Drosophila_miranda_specimen.jpg=fc43a0abd39eea68..., datasets/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md=144d0cc17c40ba2e..., datasets/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=03f46b7405f11c6b..., datasets/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=ba21cc5176da73b5..., datasets/drosophila_miranda_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=e67dc1eb5bd042c5...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing (1952) dispersion relation: a finite band of wavenumbers can grow when the inhibitor out-diffuses the activator. | Schnakenberg (1979) two-species kinetics used here as the reaction terms. | Shoup (1966) documents subcellular Drosophila eye pigment granules. | Bachtrog (2013) reviews neo-Y degeneration, including Drosophila miranda. It does not report a 1.9 µm wavelength.; reconstructed_in_script: Diffusivities solved so the fastest Schnakenberg mode on a 22.368 µm field is 1.864 µm. | Chronoseries wavelengths 1.412 µm (melanogaster) and 2.286 µm (mojavensis) at 0 Ma by D_u ∝ λ².; transfer_boundary: The species-gallery plate is the image-fitness target. It is not an electron micrograph of miranda granules.; does_not_claim: Does not claim Bachtrog (2013) measured this wavelength. | Does not claim the predecessor and successor wavelengths were measured on new specimens in this loop.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=1.5]: Pass 1 measurement set has no Pearson r, RMSE, KS, or ablation ratio.",
        "open need [parameter_sweep/parameter-expressivity, pressure P=1.3]: Pass 1 does not score the five-point D_u sweep.",
        "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=1.3]: Pass 1 does not emit plate segmentation metrics.",
        "remediation needed: Add the D_u parameter sweep (λ versus √D_u) to the figure and to measure_morphoeval.",
        "remediation needed: Add the equal-diffusion negative control and report the activator std ratio.",
        "remediation needed: Choose overlay depth by a CV sweep instead of the fixed pass-1 depth 0.22.",
        "remediation needed: Report dispersion goodness-of-fit (Pearson r, RMSE) between continuum σ(k) and the explicit-Euler symbol.",
        "remediation needed: Segment the real gallery plate (foreground, coherency, circularity, orientation KS) and emit non-circular specimen metrics." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.03e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

