    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The GIF is 12 frames at 640×480. The last frame is the gallery plate modulated by the activator. Pass 1 uses a fixed depth and does not yet score plate segmentation, so specimen-match stays below the pass-2 value. The pure field is a spot lattice, not a portrait, and the plate is not an EM." ;
